node_modules/
# **Anchored.** `dist/` unanchored matches any directory of that name at any depth, which quietly
# excluded `packages/vui-core/dist` — the vendored package's entire published output — so a clone
# installed an empty `@viliha/vui-core` and the deploy failed on "cannot find module". The leading
# slash means this app's build output and nothing else.
/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*.local
.DS_Store
